<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:10:25 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>微调医疗人工智能可以改善诊断，但也会带来隐私风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/fine-tuning-medical-ai-can-improve-diagnosis-but-also-creates-privacy-risks</link><description>陈庆宇博士和他的团队着手研究人工智能语言模型如何应用于医学，发现这些模型记忆的内容既有用又有风险。模型可能保留有价值的医学知识，但在使用真实医院记录的对照研究中，同样的微调（使模型适应特定任务的附加训练）提高了诊断性能，也使其更有可能重现在训练期间看到的材料，包括敏感的患者信息。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/fine-tuning-medical-ai-can-improve-diagnosis-but-also-creates-privacy-risks2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/fine-tuning-medical-ai-can-improve-diagnosis-but-also-creates-privacy-risks</guid></item><item><title>超人类主义宣言和困境：15 年后</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/transhumanist-manifestos-and-dilemmas-15-years-later</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/transhumanist-manifestos-and-dilemmas-15-years-later2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:55:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/transhumanist-manifestos-and-dilemmas-15-years-later</guid></item><item><title>9/11 25 年后：国土安全部使命如何转变</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/25-years-after-9-11-how-the-homeland-security-mission-has-transformed</link><description>2001 年 9 月 11 日，美国发生了永远的改变。二十五年后，那个早晨的记忆仍然令人难忘。这些袭击清楚地表明，美国无法再仅靠地理位置来抵御顽固的对手。它们揭示了我们在不对称威胁、情报共享、航空安全、边境管制、紧急通信、机构间协调和战备方面知识的弱点。它们还催生了现代国土安全企业，规模要大得多。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/25-years-after-9-11-how-the-homeland-security-mission-has-transformed2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:40:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/25-years-after-9-11-how-the-homeland-security-mission-has-transformed</guid></item><item><title>奇怪的材料越薄导电性能越好</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/strange-material-gets-better-at-conducting-electricity-the-thinner-it-gets</link><description>铜是一种备受追捧（也经常被盗）的金属，因为它为数据中心、电动汽车和能源基础设施的普及提供动力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/strange-material-gets-better-at-conducting-electricity-the-thinner-it-gets.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:25:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/strange-material-gets-better-at-conducting-electricity-the-thinner-it-gets</guid></item><item><title>HD Hyundai Robotics 触觉传感器投资：押注机器人触摸 970 万美元</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/hd-hyundai-robotics-tactile-sensor-investment-the-9-7m-bet-on-robot-touch</link><description>HD Hyundai Robotics 于 2026 年 9 月 11 日向 AIDIN Robotics 投资了 130 亿韩元（970 万美元），获得了该公司的股份，该公司为人形手制造力和触觉传感器。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/hd-hyundai-robotics-tactile-sensor-investment-the-9-7m-bet-on-robot-touch.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/hd-hyundai-robotics-tactile-sensor-investment-the-9-7m-bet-on-robot-touch</guid></item><item><title>精密光学使植物健康状况从太空可见</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/precision-optics-to-make-plant-health-visible-from-space</link><description>当欧空局地球观测任务 FLEX 于 2026 年 9 月 15 日如期发射升空时，它将携带来自德国耶拿的高精度光学组件。弗劳恩霍夫应用光学和精密工程研究所 IOF 的研究人员开发并制造了硅基双缝组件以及卫星上光谱仪的两个高精度反射镜。该光谱仪旨在检测由地球轨道阳光激发的植物的荧光。这些数据预计将为植被的光合作用、健康和压力水平提供新的见解。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/precision-optics-to-make-plant-health-visible-from-space.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:55:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/precision-optics-to-make-plant-health-visible-from-space</guid></item><item><title>网络研讨会 vs 人脑：谁将赢得智力竞赛？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/webinar-vs-human-brain-who-will-win-the-intelligence-race</link><description>探索传统教育的灵活替代方案。加入东非虚拟之旅，探索内克斯福德的项目、奖学金和在线学习体验。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/webinar-vs-human-brain-who-will-win-the-intelligence-race.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:40:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/webinar-vs-human-brain-who-will-win-the-intelligence-race</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现阿尔茨海默病的新一层隐藏在基因组中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-a-new-layer-of-alzheimers-hidden-in-the-genome</link><description>科学家发现，受阿尔茨海默病影响的几种类型的脑细胞中 DNA 的 3D 组织被破坏，从而改变了重要基因的开启和关闭程度。这一发现揭示了该疾病先前未被充分探索的层面，可能为理解并最终治疗阿尔茨海默氏症开辟新的途径。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-find-a-new-layer-of-alzheimers-hidden-in-the-genome.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:25:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-find-a-new-layer-of-alzheimers-hidden-in-the-genome</guid></item><item><title>宾夕法尼亚州试验测试超快辐射形式，旨在减少癌症治疗副作用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/penn-trial-tests-ultrafast-form-of-radiation-aimed-at-reducing-cancer-treatment-side-effects</link><description>最终的希望不仅是保持患者的生活质量，而且使放射治疗更加方便和容易获得。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/penn-trial-tests-ultrafast-form-of-radiation-aimed-at-reducing-cancer-treatment-side-effects.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:10:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/penn-trial-tests-ultrafast-form-of-radiation-aimed-at-reducing-cancer-treatment-side-effects</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，人工智能设计的药物使患者的血液在生物学上看起来更年轻</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-designed-drug-makes-patients-blood-look-biologically-younger-study-shows</link><description>您无法更改身份证件上记载的年龄。但你的身体年龄又如何呢？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-designed-drug-makes-patients-blood-look-biologically-younger-study-shows.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:55:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-designed-drug-makes-patients-blood-look-biologically-younger-study-shows</guid></item></channel></rss>